    "description": "The Telecom SIM Portability Batch Insertion API allows telecom service providers to efficiently process bulk requests for SIM card portability. This endpoint enables the submission of multiple portability cases simultaneously, streamlining the management of customer transitions between service providers. Typical consumers include telecom operators and customer service platforms seeking to automate the portability process for improved customer satisfaction. By facilitating batch updates, this API enhances operational efficiency and reduces processing time for telecom portability requests.",
